### Movie Picker API Collection
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api

### 1. Create a New Movie Picker Session
# @name createSession
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hostName": "Lanz",
  "maxUsers": 5,
  "maxSuggestionsPerUser": 3
}

### Store roomCode from the response above to use in subsequent requests
@roomCode = {{createSession.response.body.roomCode}}

### 2. Fetch Session Details by Room Code
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{roomCode}}
Accept: application/json

### 3. Join an Existing Session (User 2)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/join
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomCode": "{{roomCode}}",
  "displayName": "Alex"
}

### 4. Join an Existing Session (User 3)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/join
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomCode": "{{roomCode}}",
  "displayName": "Sarah"
}

### 5. Transition Session Status to VOTING
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{roomCode}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "VOTING"
}

### 6. Transition Session Status to COMPLETED
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{roomCode}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "COMPLETED"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------
### ERROR TESTING EXAMPLES
### -------------------------------------------------------------

### 7. ERROR TEST: Duplicate Display Name (HTTP 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/join
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomCode": "{{roomCode}}",
  "displayName": "Alex"
}

### 8. ERROR TEST: Non-existent Room Code (HTTP 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/INVALID
Accept: application/json

### 9. ERROR TEST: Invalid Request Payload (HTTP 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hostName": "",
  "maxUsers": 1
}
